===Etymology 2===
{{back-form|en|mitome}}, reinforced by {{m|en|chromosome}}. Early examples include {{m|en|biome}} (1916) and {{m|en|genome}}, from {{cog|de|Genom}} (1920).<ref>{{R:OED2}}</ref> Some association with genetics due to occurrence in {{m|en|chromosome}} and {{m|en|genome}}.

====Suffix====
